'''Jugs''' are objects spit out by [[Zebak]] while fighting him in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. Players must position the jugs to clear acid pools on the floor while he prepares his Great Roar attack.

Jugs may be pushed or pulled, and release water in a 5x5 area (3x3 with Upset Stomach enabled) when broken. Jugs can be broken by either attacking them or by letting them hit one of the boulders that Zebak spits out.

